{"title":"Career Roadmap · Clinical Lab Associate","role":"Clinical Lab Associate","summary":"A Clinical Lab Associate supports diagnostic and biomedical laboratories by processing specimens, performing laboratory tests, operating basic analytical equipment, maintaining records, and following laboratory quality and biosafety procedures.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For B.Sc Biophysics / Biomedical Science, the strongest preparation is a combination of biochemistry, molecular biology, microbiology, physiology, laboratory techniques, clinical diagnostics, and quality systems."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"A general B.Sc in Biophysics/Biomedical Science does not automatically qualify a graduate for every regulated medical-laboratory position. Some hospital/diagnostic roles require a specific Medical Laboratory Science/Technology qualification or professional registration. The exact job eligibility should therefore be checked before applying."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Stage","Typical Direction"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"B.Sc"},{"text":"Biomedical science + laboratory training"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Entry Level"},{"text":"Clinical Lab Associate / Laboratory Assistant / Biomedical Lab Assistant"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Specialist"},{"text":"Senior Lab Associate / Molecular Diagnostics Associate / Clinical Research Associate"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Laboratory Supervisor / Technical Specialist / Laboratory Manager"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During B.Sc","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Year","Focus","Skills","Proof of Progress"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Biological foundation"},{"text":"Cell biology, chemistry, anatomy, physiology"},{"text":"Basic laboratory competency"}],[{"text":"Year 