","Excel","Basic Python","LIMS"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Professional"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accuracy","Scientific Documentation","Communication","Confidentiality"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Progression"},{"type":"h","text":"B.Sc Biophysics / Biomedical Science"},{"type":"flow","items":["Biomedical laboratory foundation","Molecular & clinical diagnostics","Laboratory internship","Role-specific clinical laboratory qualification if required","Clinical Lab Associate / Laboratory Assistant","Senior Lab Associate","Laboratory Specialist / Supervisor","Laboratory Manager"]},{"type":"h","text":"Best overall positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Sc Biophysics/Biomedical Science","hands-on laboratory experience","clinical biochemistry","molecular diagnostics","laboratory quality systems","biostatistics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The most important point is that the degree provides a strong scientific foundation, but the title \"Clinical Lab Associate\" should be treated as employer- and jurisdiction-dependent. For regulated diagnostic laboratory positions, the student should verify the required professional qualification before committing to this pathway."}]}]}